Upstream licence terms

TFMCSpiders is a fork of minecraft-spider by TheCymaera
(https://github.com/TheCymaera/minecraft-spider). The upstream project
publishes these terms in its README:

    You may use the plugin and source code for both commercial or
    non-commercial purposes.

    Attribution is appreciated but not due.

    Do not resell without making substantial changes.

No separate licence has been chosen for the TF-Minecraft changes in this
repository. Third-party dependencies retain their own licenses.
